Instal modul menggunakan npm:\n\n```bash\nnpm install bycf\n```\n\n## 📖 Dokumentasi Lengkap\n\nUntuk panduan penggunaan yang lebih mendalam, contoh kode (WAF Session, Turnstile Min/Max, Get Source, Server Stats), arsitektur engine, dan penanganan error, **harap membaca dokumentasi resmi kami di:**\n\n### 👉 [https://bycf.nett.to/docs](https://bycf.nett.to/docs)\n\n## ⚡ Contoh Singkat (Quick Start)\n\n```javascript\n// CommonJS\nconst { shz: bycf } = require('bycf');\n\n// ES Modules\n// import { shz as bycf } from 'bycf';\n\n(async () => {\n    try {\n        // 1. Dapatkan Statistik Server\n        const stats = await bycf.stats();\n        \n        // 2. Selesaikan Turnstile CF \n        const token = await bycf.turnstileMin('https://web-target.com', '0x4AAAAAA...');\n        console.log(\"Token Anda:\", token);\n\n        // 3. Bypass WAF & Ambil Cookie\n        const session = await bycf.wafSession('https://web-target.com');\n        console.log(\"Cookies Bypass:\", session.cookies);\n    } catch(err) {\n        console.error(err.message);\n    }\n})();\n```\n\n---\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  Built by Shannz &copy; 2026\n</div>\n","readmeFilename":"README.md"}